{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  Turn2Opinion — email system v1 ("the conversation")
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 04. Reset password
  File       : reset-password.liquid
  Class      : Auth (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : Password reset requested (record-led variant of 03)
  Tone       : night
  Replaces   : reset-password.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Create a new Turn2Opinion password
    2. {% assign _nw = user.name.first | default: "" | strip | downcase | split: " " %}{% assign _no = "" %}{% for _w in _nw %}{% if _w != "" %}{% assign _nc = _w | capitalize %}{% if _no == "" %}{% assign _no = _nc %}{% else %}{% assign _no = _no | append: " " | append: _nc %}{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if _no != "" %}{{ _no }}{% else %}{% endif %}, create your new password
    3. Your password reset link is inside

  PREHEADER
    A single-use link to choose a new password, valid for 24 hours.

  PRIMARY CTA
    Create a new password  ->  forgot-password?user=…&code=…

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/reset-password.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/04-reset-password.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
